+ *    0.95  "1.0 beta 5"     0.95      95  0.95  [should have been 2.0.95]
+ *    0.96  "1.0 beta 6"     0.96      96  0.96  [should have been 2.0.96]
+ *    0.97b "1.00.97 beta 7" 1.00.97   97  1.0.1 [should have been 2.0.97]
+ *    0.97c                  0.97      97  2.0.97
